# ---- ROS 2 / colcon build artifacts (never commit; regenerated by `colcon build`) ----
build/
install/
log/

# ---- Python bytecode ----
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# ---- Backups / scratch ----
*.bak
*.bak-*
*~

# ---- Generated reports / graphs ----
frames_*.gv
frames_*.pdf
provenance_report.txt

# ---- Script outputs (regenerated at runtime) ----
*.csv

# ---- Personal recordings (each user records their own) ----
keyframes_*.json
teleop_left_*.json
elbow_bend_test.json

# ---- AI session notes / local tooling (personal) ----
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
SESSION_HANDOFF.md

# NOTE: calibration files are intentionally NOT ignored --
#   src/humanoid_arms/scripts/servo_calibration.json
#   src/humanoid_arms/scripts/mirror_calibration.json
# They are the author's hardware calibration, kept as a working example + schema.
# Anyone using real hardware MUST recalibrate for their own arm (see README).
